Well before you reach XL14 most humans and elves are bug-on-the
windshield grade.  Upon entering Gehennom none of them except priests
matter, and those aren't randomly generated (and are 90% vulnerable to
wands of death anyway). Angelic beings are incredibly rare pre-Planes; by 
the time you hit the Planes, the only threat is an Archon, and he's
vulnerable to teleportation.  (Pre-plane Archons you teleport _yourself_
away from, generally.)

When almost nothing is big enough to hurt you before you get yourself
tanked out to indestructible levels, there's not much balance there.

